TEXT 0 2016 Left 2 ;B5_proposed_nmos_xc_ptat, testbench B_tr
TEXT 0 2056 Left 2 ;Nets are joined by their labels (same name = same net). Open in LTspice and press Run.
TEXT 0 2096 Left 2 ;Unity-gain follower, +/-0.2 V step, CL = 2 pF behind Rs. Slew = 20-80 % slope of V(oL) (the load capacitor).
TEXT 0 2136 Left 2 !.include ptm90.lib
TEXT 0 2176 Left 2 !.tran 0 900n 0 0.2n
TEXT 0 2216 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_r20 WHEN V(oL)=-0.12 RISE=1
TEXT 0 2256 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_r80 WHEN V(oL)=0.12 RISE=1
TEXT 0 2296 Left 2 !.meas TRAN sr_rise_V_per_us PARAM 0.24/(t_r80-t_r20)/1e6
TEXT 0 2336 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_f80 WHEN V(oL)=0.12 FALL=1
TEXT 0 2376 Left 2 !.meas TRAN t_f20 WHEN V(oL)=-0.12 FALL=1
TEXT 0 2416 Left 2 !.meas TRAN sr_fall_V_per_us PARAM -0.24/(t_f20-t_f80)/1e6
